# Project overview

The repository is a voice-assistant system with three main areas:

```text
Android/iOS React Native app
        ↓ authenticated PCM16 WebSocket
FastAPI voice gateway
        ↓
Remote STT → Memory/RAG → NVIDIA LLM → Tools
        ↓ streamed events
React Native conversation UI
```

The canonical source is split into:

```text
voice_assistance/
├── frontend/      React Native UI and Android/iOS native code
├── backend/       FastAPI, STT, LLM, tools, memory and persistence
├── scripts/       Validation and developer automation
├── docker/        Container definitions
├── docs/          Implementation reports and acceptance evidence
├── models/        Local wake-word model files
└── scratch/       Temporary diagnostics and validation state
```

Generated dependencies, caches, binaries and logs are summarized rather than listing every third-party DLL or package.

