## Android native project

`frontend/android/` contains the Gradle Android application.

### Android build files

- `settings.gradle`: includes the application and React Native Gradle plugin.
- `build.gradle`: repository-wide Android build configuration.
- `app/build.gradle`: application ID, SDK versions, dependencies and packaging.
- `gradle.properties`: Gradle/React Native build properties.
- `gradlew`, `gradlew.bat`, `gradle/wrapper/*`: pinned Gradle wrapper.
- `AndroidManifest.xml`: permissions, activity and application registration.
- `proguard-rules.pro`: Android release shrinking/obfuscation rules.
- `debug.keystore`: local debug signing key.

### Android Kotlin source

`com.voiceaipoc/`:

- `MainActivity.kt`: React Native Android activity.
- `MainApplication.kt`: application initialization and native-package registration.
- `rn/VoiceModule.kt`: native methods and events exposed to TypeScript.
- `rn/VoicePackage.kt`: registers `VoiceModule`.

`audio/`:

- `AudioConfig.kt`: PCM format and capture constants.
- `AudioEffectsManager.kt`: acoustic echo cancellation and noise suppression.
- `AudioEngine.kt`: Android `AudioRecord` capture lifecycle.
- `AudioNormalizer.kt`: audio amplitude normalization.
- `AudioRingBuffer.kt`: bounded pre-roll/ring buffering.
- `PcmAudioPipeline.kt`: processes captured PCM before transport/VAD.

`auth/`:

- `SecureTokenStorage.kt`: encrypted Android storage for access/refresh tokens.

`vad/`:

- `VadConfig.kt`, `VadEngine.kt`: voice-activity detection configuration and lifecycle.
- `silero/AndroidSileroVadModelAsset.kt`: model-asset loading.
- `AndroidSileroVadRuntimeFactory.kt`: creates the ONNX runtime.
- `OnnxSileroVadRuntime.kt`: executes Silero through ONNX.
- `SileroVadConfig.kt`: model thresholds and window settings.
- `SileroVadEngine.kt`: coordinates inference and speech boundaries.
- `SileroVadModelContract.kt`: expected model tensor contract.
- `SileroVadRuntime.kt`: runtime abstraction.
- `SileroVadStateMachine.kt`: speech/silence transition logic.

`wakeword/`:

- Model asset and runtime factories.
- ONNX runtime and OpenWakeWord model contracts.
- PCM preprocessing.
- Wake-word state machine and engine.
- Acoustic diagnostics, capture, replay, calibration and manual-trial diagnostics.

`voice/`:

- `VoiceBinaryFrame.kt`: encodes the `VAI1` binary PCM protocol.
- `PcmSendQueue.kt`: bounded outgoing audio queue.
- `VoiceWebSocketTransport.kt`: authenticated native WebSocket transport.

### Native assets and tests

- `assets/openwakeword/*.onnx`: wake-word models and feature models.
- `assets/silero_vad/silero_vad.onnx`: Silero VAD model.
- `res/`: Android launcher icons, styles and application strings.
- `src/test/`: local JVM tests for audio, VAD, wake-word, storage and transport.
- `src/androidTest/`: physical-device microphone, gateway and authentication tests.

