## Backend application entry point

[backend/app/main.py](C:/Users/lenovo/Desktop/voice_assistance/backend/app/main.py) creates FastAPI and owns application startup/shutdown:

- loads settings;
- configures logging;
- connects PostgreSQL and Redis;
- initializes STT;
- initializes the selected LLM provider;
- initializes embedding/reranking and retrieval;
- starts the memory worker when enabled;
- mounts API routes;
- closes tasks, providers and database connections safely.

## `backend/app/core/`

- `config.py`: all validated settings loaded from environment variables.
- `logging.py`: structured JSON logging, request IDs and request middleware.
- `clock.py`: real and frozen clocks for production/testing.
- `async_utils.py`: cancellation-safe asynchronous cleanup helpers.
- `__init__.py`: package marker.

## `backend/app/db/`

- `session.py`: SQLAlchemy async engine/session factory and database lifecycle.
- `dependencies.py`: FastAPI database-session dependency.
- `__init__.py`: package marker.

## `backend/app/api/`

- `routes.py`: combines all routers and defines `/health` and `/ready`.
- `auth.py`: registration, login, refresh, logout, profile and auth-session endpoints.
- `devices.py`: device registration, listing and revocation.
- `sessions.py`: voice-session listing, update, memory exclusion, cancellation and deletion.
- `memories.py`: memory settings, CRUD, search and delete-all endpoints.
- `tasks.py`: task CRUD endpoints.
- `voice.py`: authenticated `/v1/voice` production gateway.
- `websocket.py`: authenticated general `/ws` endpoint.
- `dependencies.py`: bearer-token extraction and authenticated principal dependencies.
- `__init__.py`: package marker.

## `backend/app/models/`

- `base.py`: SQLAlchemy declarative base.
- `auth.py`: `User`, `Device`, `AuthSession` and `AuditLog`.
- `voice.py`: `VoiceSession` and `ConversationTurn`.
- `resources.py`: `MemoryItem`, `Message`, `MemoryChunk`, `Entity`, `MemoryEntity`, `MemoryJob`, `Task` and `ToolExecutionRecord`.
- `__init__.py`: exports/registers models.

## `backend/app/schemas/`

- `auth.py`: Pydantic request/response models for auth, users, devices and sessions.
- `resources.py`: memory, task and voice-session request/response models.
- `__init__.py`: schema package exports.

## `backend/app/services/`

- `auth.py`: password hashing, JWT issuance/verification, refresh rotation and logout.
- `audit.py`: sanitized audit logging that removes sensitive values.
- `infrastructure.py`: PostgreSQL/Redis startup, readiness and shutdown.
- `ownership.py`: user-scoped resource lookup and denial auditing.
- `voice_registry.py`: Redis leases for active voice sessions, turns, responses and cancellation.
- `voice_persistence.py`: durable voice-session and turn database writes.
- `voice_confirmation.py`: pending confirmation storage and parsing of YES/NO responses.
- `task_due_dates.py`: timezone-aware relative date/time parsing.
- `tool_idempotency.py`: PostgreSQL-backed exactly-once tool execution claims.
- `__init__.py`: package marker.

## `backend/app/websocket/`

- `binary.py`: `VAI1` binary PCM frame encoding/decoding.
- `protocol.py`: validated client control messages and server event creation.
- `state.py`: connection/session/turn state machine and sequence validation.
- `cancellation.py`: cancellation guard used to reject late processing.
- `gateway.py`: central orchestration for audio, STT, transcript persistence, LLM streaming, tools, memory, confirmation, retry and cleanup.
- `__init__.py`: package marker.

## `backend/app/stt/`

- `base.py`: provider-neutral STT engine interface, event types and stable errors.
- `service.py`: turn lifecycle, audio limits, transcript events and engine orchestration.
- `remote_engine.py`: production remote transcription HTTP adapter.
- `diagnostic_capture.py`: optional sanitized PCM diagnostic capture.
- `evaluation.py`: transcript normalization and word-error-rate calculation.
- `protocol.py`: legacy Windows worker process protocol.
- `windows_engine.py`: adapter for the legacy Windows STT worker.
- `whisper_engine.py`: optional local faster-whisper adapter.
- `__init__.py`: STT package exports.

## `backend/app/llm/`

- `types.py`: provider-neutral messages, requests, tool calls, usage and streaming events.
- `provider.py`: abstract LLM provider protocol.
- `factory.py`: selects the configured provider.
- `service.py`: provider lifecycle, concurrency, retries, cancellation and normalized streaming.
- `context.py`: system instructions, memory-context construction and tool-routing policy.
- `errors.py`: stable configuration, auth, rate-limit, timeout, provider and tool errors.
- `tool_loop.py`: tool registry, authorization, execution, idempotency and iterative LLM tool loop.
- `task_tools.py`: `create_task` schema, normalization and execution.
- `providers/openai_chat.py`: OpenAI-compatible streaming adapter.
- `providers/nvidia.py`: NVIDIA provider built on the compatible chat adapter.
- `providers/openai_responses.py`: OpenAI Responses API adapter.
- `providers/anthropic_messages.py`: Anthropic Messages adapter.
- package `__init__.py` files: module exports.

## `backend/app/memory/`

- `types.py`: memory types/statuses, job states, query plans and retrieval-result models.
- `policy.py`: extraction safety, JSON validation and candidate policy.
- `extraction.py`: automatic durable explicit durable-memory extraction logic.
- `chunking.py`: bounded overlapping memory text chunks.
- `repository.py`: user-scoped memory persistence and job enqueueing.
- `writer.py`: durable write, deduplication, conflict and supersession handling.
- `jobs.py`: database-backed job claiming, extraction, embedding, retry and failure handling.
- `worker_service.py`: production memory-worker background loop.
- `worker_main.py`: standalone memory-worker process entry point.
- `providers.py`: remote BGE-M3 embedding and reranker HTTP clients.
- `retrieval.py`: structured, lexical and vector retrieval, fusion, reranking and relevance rejection.
- `fusion.py`: public re-export of fusion/reranking functions.
- `context.py`: converts accepted memories into safe untrusted LLM context.
- `tool_tools.py`: `memory_search`, `memory_save` and `memory_forget` tools.
- `__init__.py`: memory package exports.

